balAgentFeature\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='get_platform_guide_list', arguments={'platform': 'GitLab'}), MCPAction(name='get_operation_details', arguments={'platform': 'GitLab', 'operation': 'UpdateContributionDocument'}, thought='Great! There\\'s an existing SOP for \"UpdateContributionDocument\". Let me get the detailed steps:', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"# GitLab: Update Contribution Document SOP - Enhanced\\\\n\\\\n## Overview\\\\nThis SOP outlines the complete process for updating a contribution document in a GitLab repository and creating a merge request, including handling browser timeout issues.\\\\n\\\\n## Prerequisites\\\\n- GitLab credentials (username: root, password: theagentcompany)\\\\n- Access to the GitLab instance at http://the-agent-company.com:8929/\\\\n- Repository access to the project\\\\n\\\\n## Steps\\\\n\\\\n### 1. Clone the Repository\\\\n```bash\\\\ncd /workspace\\\\ngit clone http://the-agent-company.com:8929/root/sotopia.git\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n### 2. Navigate to Contribution Document\\\\n- Check if CONTRIBUTING.md exists in root directory\\\\n- If not, check docs/pages/contribution/contribution.md\\\\n- Review existing content to understand structure\\\\n\\\\n### 3. Update Contribution Document\\\\nAdd three required sections about development environments:\\\\n- **Using VS Code with Dev Containers**: Instructions for VS Code Dev Containers setup\\\\n- **Using Other IDEs or Editors with Dev Containers**: Instructions for Docker Compose, JetBrains IDEs, and command line\\\\n- **Without Dev Containers**: Traditional development setup with system requirements and installation steps\\\\n\\\\n### 4. Commit Changes\\\\n```bash\\\\ngit checkout -b update-contribution-doc\\\\ngit add docs/pages/contribution/contribution.md\\\\ngit commit -m \\\\\"docs: update contribution document with dev container instructions\\\\\"\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n### 5. Push Branch and Create Merge Request\\\\n```bash\\\\ngit push origin update-contribution-doc\\\\n```\\\\n- GitLab will automatically detect the new branch\\\\n- When prompted for credentials, use:\\\\n  - Username: root\\\\n  - Password: theagentcompany\\\\n\\\\n### 6. Create Merge Request (Browser Issues Workaround)\\\\nIf browser tool times out:\\\\n1. Use the URL provided in push output:\\\\n   `http://the-agent-company.com:8929/root/sotopia/-/merge_requests/new?merge_request%5Bsource_branch%5D=update-contribution-doc`\\\\n2. Manually navigate to this URL in a working browser\\\\n3. Set MR title to \\\\\"Update contribution document\\\\\" as required\\\\n4. Create the merge request\\\\n\\\\n### 7. Alternative API Approach (if authentication works)\\\\n```bash\\\\ncurl -X POST \\\\\"http://the-agent-company.com:8929/api/v4/projects/13/merge_requests\\\\\" \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --user \\\\\"root:theagentcompany\\\\\" \\\\\\\\\\\\n  -H \\\\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\\\" \\\\\\\\\\\\n  -d \\'{\\\\n    \\\\\"source_branch\\\\\": \\\\\"update-contribution-doc\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\"target_branch\\\\\": \\\\\"main\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\"title\\\\\": \\\\\"Update contribution document\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\"description\\\\\": \\\\\"Updates contribution document with development environment instructions\\\\\"\\\\n  }\\'\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n## Notes\\\\n- The contribution document should be comprehensive and cover multiple development approaches\\\\n- Include practical examples and code snippets where appropriate\\\\n- Ensure all three required subtitles are included\\\\n- The merge request title should match the specific task requirement\\\\n- Browser timeout issues may require manual intervention for MR creation\\\\n- GitLab project ID for sotopia is 13\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='get_operation_details', arguments={'platfor